OL,3,GNEWSAFrustration after generator       
OL,4,Afailure forces school to close again   
OL,6,FParents have expressed their           
OL,7,Ffrustration after a school in County   
OL,8,FArmagh was temporarily closed again due
OL,9,Fto a power outage.                     
OL,11,FMarkethill High School was closed on   
OL,12,FMonday due to a mechanical failure of a
OL,13,Ftemporary generator that had been      
OL,14,Fproviding power during an ongoing      
OL,15,Fupgrade, and pupils were asked to study
OL,16,Ffrom home on Tuesday.                  
OL,18,FPower supply issues have affected the  
OL,19,Fschool on a number of occasions since 2
OL,20,FSeptember.                             
