OL,3,GNEWSAFrustration after generator       
OL,4,Afailure forces school to close again   
OL,6,FAshley McCracken, who has two children 
OL,7,Fat the school, said "children have a   
OL,8,Fright to education and right now they  
OL,9,Fare not even getting a basic           
OL,10,Feducation".                            
